{"id": "DfcSnk6xn-Z", "title": "Video by anim_aman", "description": "Kabhi kabhi ghar ki nahi, uss waqt ki yaad aati hai jab hum ghar pe hua karte the. 🌙\n\nWoh dost, woh galiyan, maa ki awaaz aur woh befikar sa ladka jo kabhi hum hua karte the.\n\nPhir ek din ghar wapas jaate ho, sab kuch wahi hota hai, bas pehle jaisa kuch nahi lagta.\n\nJis zindagi ke liye ghar chhoda tha, woh mil bhi gayi… par shayad kuch peeche reh gaya. 🌊\n\n🎵 Tu Bhi Dariya — @yashtrivedi9 \n\nUss dost ko bhejo jo ghar se door apni duniya bana raha hai. 💙", "channel": "anim_aman", "uploader_id": "52657595533", "uploader": "Aman", "timestamp": 1794058224, "like_count": 356, "comment_count": 12, "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-Language": "en-us,en;q=0.5", "Sec-Fetch-Mode": "navigate", "Referer": "https://www.instagram.com/"}, "formats": [{"format_id": "dash-1106264645556591a", "ext": "m4a", "tbr": 65.608, "asr": 44100, "format_note": "DASH audio", "container": "m4a_dash", "vcodec": "none", "acodec": "mp4a.40.5", "url": "https://scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com/o1/v/t2/f2/m78/AQMJPf_wGCxkjf0G7H4D5PX5rJH4_oN_xQy8HvpZx_KVjhpTj0vdMb8HFLpkjf7LuPRNwYRT137GxhcwqNtsd7l3CLdq6Bsn0cCWmfA.mp4?_nc_cat=105&_nc_sid=9ca052&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.cdninstagram.com&_nc_ohc=_Di9Exfogw4Q7kNvwGO9_Rv&&ccb=17-1&_nc_gid=XmdwwJul2yXgYdOqxN2Osg&_nc_ss=70689&_nc_zt=28&oh=00_AQSZEp29tMdL8qTjt2V8uC-3C0IgEjL7lUlKw7u_JXDUmA&oe=6AF3E3B2", "manifest_stream_number": 0, "is_dash_periods": true, "protocol": "https", "audio_ext": "m4a", "video_ext": "none", "vbr": 0, "abr": 65.608, "resolution": "audio only", "http_headers": {"User-Agent": "Mozilla/5.0 (Windows NT 10.0; Win64; x64) AppleWebKit/537.36 (KHTML, like Gecko) Chrome/148.0.0.0 Safari/537.36", "Accept": "text/html,application/xhtml+xml,application/xml;q=0.9,*/*;q=0.8", "Accept-L